>>
>> Hmmm... in pseudo-criminal law terms, "Conspiracy to abuse the email
>> privilege," or possibly something akin to a RICO offense.
>
> Now this is a hard thing, who determines what this consipricy is, and
> how do you punish it.  More to the point, why must we even punish
